{"id":1060101,"chapter_id":1060101,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"殷红的幕布拉开，台下坐满了黑压压的观众。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101001,"trial_step":1,"drawing":1060100},{"step":2,"speaker":"报幕员","content":"接下来请欣赏独舞——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":11,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1060100},{"step":3,"content":"“啪——”，话音刚落，一束灼热的聚光灯亮起，炙烤着你的头顶。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1060100},{"step":4,"content":"此时你终于看清了台下观众的面目——它们是一只只黑色幽影，冒着诡异的幽光，带着杀气正向你扑来！","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1060100},{"step":5,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1060100},{"step":6,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1060100},{"step":7,"content":"夜莺的声音将你拉回现实。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1060100},{"step":8,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"按照您的要求，FAC尽可能出动了所有战斗力量，污染清理已经基本完成。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1060100},{"step":9,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"但您最关心的问题——禁闭者哈梅尔，她……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1060100},{"step":10,"options":["她出什么事了？"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101010,"trial_step":10,"course":3,"drawing":1060100,"choices":[{"text":"她出什么事了？","goto":11}]},{"step":11,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"她的精神不太稳定。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1060100},{"step":12,"content":"……二十三年来一直与死役共处，失去时间的概念在幻觉世界不停跳舞，突然回到现实肯定会不习惯吧。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1060100},{"step":13,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"不……情况恐怕比您想象得更加糟糕，她的精神状况对她的记忆甚至启迪异能都造成了影响。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1060100},{"step":14,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"导致精神不稳定具体的原因，恐怕还需要局长通过审查进一步了解。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1060100},{"step":15,"content":"夜莺神色并不轻松。但即便她对哈梅尔的情况做了诸多铺垫，进入审查室时，哈梅尔迷惘的状态依然还是让人有些意外。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1060101},{"step":16,"content":"哈梅尔……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1060100},{"step":17,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"局……长？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1060100},{"step":18,"content":"她似乎还没有完全适应这个称呼，不安地攥紧裙摆。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1060100},{"step":19,"content":"优雅、温柔、坚强、善良……你对她在嘉年华的一切印象如今都被封在迷蒙惊悸之下。难以想象，镇压死役究竟是以怎样的精神力为代价……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1060100},{"step":20,"options":["别紧张","不用勉强自己"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101021,"trial_step":21,"course":3,"drawing":1060100,"choices":[{"text":"别紧张","goto":22},{"text":"不用勉强自己","goto":null}]},{"step":21,"content":"我们都很感激你的付出，希望能帮你找到使你精神不稳定的原因。如果你不喜欢这样的形式，也可以换个地方聊聊。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1060100},{"step":22,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"你们？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1060100},{"step":23,"content":"是的，帮助海拉和赫卡蒂走出心魔，镇压死役避免了FAC和MBCC战力的消耗，你帮了很多人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1060100},{"step":24,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我？……帮过你们？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1060100},{"step":25,"content":"你真的一点都不记得了吗？嘉年华里，有一个模仿你的“哈梅尔”，有三个要守护你舞蹈的傀儡，还有帕尔马和他穿着雨衣的手下……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1060100},{"step":26,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"模仿我……傀儡……？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1060100},{"step":27,"content":"你突然输出的大量信息令她有些慌张，蹙眉重复着你的话不停地摇头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1060100},{"step":28,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我、我不记得了，我只知道我在起舞……不停地旋转……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1060100},{"step":29,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"从我进入那个舞池到被你唤醒，似乎过去了数十年，又似乎……只经历了短短一瞬。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1060101},{"step":30,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"起舞，起舞……这就是我在那场梦里，唯一清晰的记忆。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1060101},{"step":31,"options":["那你还记得我吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101032,"trial_step":32,"course":3,"drawing":1060101,"choices":[{"text":"那你还记得我吗？","goto":33}]},{"step":32,"content":"枷锁微微亮起红光，将你指尖的温度传递给对方。哈梅尔只是低头看了看，露出一个浅浅的微笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1060100},{"step":33,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"是熟悉的、亲切的温度……要是能想起来，就好了。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1060100},{"step":34,"content":"关于你的事，她似乎也忘记了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1060100},{"step":35,"content":"我会回来接你的！","style":2,"background":50805,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1060100},{"step":36,"content":"这不是结束！","style":2,"background":50805,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1060100},{"step":37,"content":"为你自己跳舞！","style":2,"background":50805,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1060100},{"step":38,"content":"我给你舞台！","style":2,"background":50805,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1060100},{"step":39,"content":"等我……","style":2,"background":50805,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1060100},{"step":40,"options":["没关系","我会帮你想起来的"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101041,"trial_step":41,"course":3,"drawing":1060100,"choices":[{"text":"没关系","goto":42},{"text":"我会帮你想起来的","goto":null}]},{"step":41,"content":"我们还有很多时间，一定会想起来的……现在最要紧的，还是先找到精神不稳定的原因，尽快让你习惯环外的世界。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1060100},{"step":42,"content":"你仍然保持着温和与耐心，但难免还是有些失落。你履行了你们的约定，但她却已经忘记了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1060100},{"step":43,"content":"这份并未明说的无奈和失落，还是被哈梅尔敏锐地捕捉到了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1060100},{"step":44,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我很想帮你，想要回忆起这道红光背后的故事，可是……那个声音撕开了过去，太多的记忆涌出。我……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1060100},{"step":45,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我还来不及从里面找到你……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1060101},{"step":46,"content":"声音？什么声音？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1060100},{"step":47,"content":"这或许是侵扰哈梅尔精神的关键。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1060100},{"step":48,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"是他离开前，最后留下的话……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1060100},{"step":49,"content":"哈梅尔的视线落在了你手边的物证袋上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1060100},{"step":50,"content":"这是嘉年华门口一位老者交给我的，他说用它就能找到你的下落……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1060100},{"step":51,"content":"在湖底我把吊坠还给了你，直到你被FAC救出。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1060100},{"step":52,"content":"你从中听见了什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1060100},{"step":53,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"老者……吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1060101},{"step":54,"content":"她的声音似乎夹杂着一些哽咽。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1060101},{"step":55,"content":"是的，一名满头白发的老人。怎么了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1060101},{"step":56,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"不，没什么。是我忘记了，不是只有时间才会让人衰老……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1060100},{"step":57,"content":"她轻轻叹了口气，露出一个有些悲戚的微笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1060101},{"step":58,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"是他，他一遍遍对我重复着——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1060100},{"step":59,"content":"哈梅尔将信物捧在耳边。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1060100},{"step":60,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"“对不起，姐姐，我终于……见到你了……”","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1060100},{"step":61,"content":"姐姐？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1060100},{"step":62,"content":"你还没来得及追问，陌生的少年突然出现在审查室。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1060100},{"step":63,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>姐姐，快！趁他们还没找来，我带你去一个谁都找不到的地方！</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1060101},{"step":64,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>少年的气质忧郁干净，说这话时似乎下了极大的决心。</i></color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1060101},{"step":65,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>放心，我年轻，有的是力气，运货、拉车我什么都能干。</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1060101},{"step":66,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>我知道，你已经受够了这样的日子，你害怕舞台。但只要有我在，没人能逼你跳舞。</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1060101},{"step":67,"content":"这是？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1060101},{"step":68,"content":"枷锁的感应已经给了你答案，这是哈梅尔用能力制造的幻象。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1060101},{"step":69,"content":"而幻象中的少年，蓝色的长发、颈间的吊坠，莫名熟悉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1060101},{"step":70,"options":["这个少年是你的弟弟？","这个少年就是嘉年华的老者"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"drawing":1060101,"choices":[{"text":"这个少年是你的弟弟？","goto":75},{"text":"这个少年就是嘉年华的老者","goto":null}]},{"step":71,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"嗯，这是在我进入黑环之前的故事……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1060101},{"step":72,"content":"她看着手心的吊坠，指尖轻轻拂过自己泛黄的小像。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1060101},{"step":73,"content":"哈梅尔的时间随着黑环共同停滞，样貌没有任何的改变。可身为弟弟的诺曼却变成了白发苍苍的老人……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1060101},{"step":74,"content":"岁月和天赋对这对姐弟都不太公平。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1060101},{"step":75,"speaker":"诺曼","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>不许再上台！医生说了你恐惧舞台！不想再晕倒再犯病的话，就听我的！</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1060101},{"step":76,"speaker":"诺曼","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>我只要你留在这里，留在我身边！赚钱的事不用你操心！</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1060101},{"step":77,"speaker":"诺曼","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>我这都是为你好……为了你！！！</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1060101},{"step":78,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>诺曼……对不起……</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1060101},{"step":79,"speaker":"诺曼","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>你什么都不懂……我该怎么办……我到底该怎么办……</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1060101},{"step":80,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>少年绝望地背过身去，与姐姐之间隔开了交流的鸿沟。</i></color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1060101},{"step":81,"content":"你们似乎有过一些矛盾。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1060101},{"step":82,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"他被泥泞缠住了双脚，变得急躁。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1060101},{"step":83,"content":"泥泞指的是生活压力吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1060101},{"step":84,"content":"你渐渐能跟上哈梅尔表达的步调了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1060101},{"step":85,"content":"她点了点头，又一挥手，新的幻境展开。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1060101},{"step":86,"speaker":"弟弟","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>不用担心明天的晚饭……不用忍受工头的打骂……不用害怕姐姐被夺走……</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1060101},{"step":87,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>诺曼……你今天去了哪里？你的状态有些不对……</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1060101},{"step":88,"speaker":"弟弟","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>没事，只要进入嘉年华，我的烦恼都会消失……</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1060101},{"step":89,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>幻境中的哈梅尔拉住少年，一遍遍劝诫——</i></color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1060101},{"step":90,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>不，快停下！</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1060101},{"step":91,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>她只身走入了危险的狂欢之中，将诺曼推远。</i></color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1060101},{"step":92,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>游行的人群淹没了她的身影，伴随她的舞步，一道全新的巨大幻象展开，将姐弟二人隔绝在新乐园的内外。</i></color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1060101},{"step":93,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>离开这里，永远不要进来——</i></color>","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1060101},{"step":94,"content":"幻象散去，只留下哈梅尔来自过去的哀告回响在审查室里。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1060101},{"step":95,"content":"故事的主人公低头看向手里唯一的信物，轻轻合上了吊坠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1060101},{"step":96,"content":"这就是你留在黑环的原因？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1060101},{"step":97,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"因为我，他才有了那么多烦恼，才会迷恋嘉年华的热闹。为了阻止他再次进入那个危险的地方，我只能这么做。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1060101},{"step":98,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"原以为他能放下这些过去，去开始自己的生活。但是我忽略了……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1060101},{"step":99,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"身为姐弟，除了相貌，我们总还有些相似的地方，顽固、坚持……他竟一直守在乐园之外，那么多年。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1060101},{"step":100,"content":"一场影响狄斯数十年的黑环失踪之谜，起因竟是为了阻止弟弟误入歧途。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1060101},{"step":101,"content":"第一名公开的禁闭者，觉醒的起因竟比起那些或是悲伤或是仇恨的故事，都要“渺小”得多？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1060101},{"step":102,"content":"抱歉，你的弟弟诺曼他……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1060101},{"step":103,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我知道，我能感觉到……他已经不在了，对吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1060100},{"step":104,"content":"是的，在FAC清剿湖底死役将你带出来时，我们又确认过一次，没有发现其他幸存者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1060100},{"step":105,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"嗯……或许舞曲的终章，早已写好了。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1060100},{"step":106,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我因诺曼而进入了嘉年华，在我离开嘉年华前，我也听见了……他最后的声音。","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1060100},{"step":107,"content":"她低头，用无奈且怜惜的眼神，端详着岁月在吊坠上留下的痕迹。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1060101},{"step":108,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"是我不好……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1060101},{"step":109,"options":["不是你的错","都过去了……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101117,"trial_step":117,"course":3,"drawing":1060101,"choices":[{"text":"不是你的错","goto":118},{"text":"都过去了……","goto":null}]},{"step":110,"content":"那是二十余年相互牵挂却不曾相见的至亲的离开，言语上的安慰无论如何都略显单薄。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1060101},{"step":111,"content":"他在离开前拜托我替他看一眼你的舞蹈。他的心愿已经实现了，走的时候应该没有太痛苦……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1060101},{"step":112,"content":"他已经离开了，你也该解脱了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1060101},{"step":113,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"解……脱？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1060101},{"step":114,"speaker":"？？","content":"不，她还不能解脱——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1060101},{"step":115,"content":"谁在说话？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1060101},{"step":116,"content":"嗡——\n不等你们做出反应，你突然感到一阵头晕耳鸣，新的幻象覆盖了视野。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1060102},{"step":117,"content":"漆黑混沌的色彩遮住了审查室所有灯光，幽影伸出触角将你们包围。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1060102},{"step":118,"content":"你见过这个幽影！在审查前恍神的片段中，在舞台的观众席里。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1060102},{"step":119,"options":["这也是你的幻术吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101127,"trial_step":127,"course":3,"drawing":1060102,"choices":[{"text":"这也是你的幻术吗？","goto":128}]},{"step":120,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"不……它是……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1060102},{"step":121,"speaker":"幽影","content":"我是你的一部分，你的困惑、你的迷茫、你的孤独、你在噩梦中所见的一切……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1060102},{"step":122,"content":"噩梦？你在审查前见到的，难道是源于枷锁造成的精神链接？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1060102},{"step":123,"content":"幽影似带同情地拂过你的脸颊。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1060102},{"step":124,"speaker":"幽影","content":"他有自己的疑惑、目的和渴望，你呢？哈梅尔，你的答案是什么？","female_content":"她有自己的疑惑、目的和渴望，你呢？哈梅尔，你的答案是什么？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1060102},{"step":125,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我……我已经给出了答案……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1060102},{"step":126,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"嘉年华很危险……我，我只能……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1060102},{"step":127,"speaker":"幽影","content":"环碎了，诺曼离开了，没有理由再留下了……为何要牺牲自己，为何与死役共舞？你知道的，你一定知道答案——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1060102},{"step":128,"content":"幽影朝着哈梅尔一步步逼近，哈梅尔身为幻境的主人却无法阻止它的诘问，无助地捂住耳朵。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1060102},{"step":129,"speaker":"幽影","content":"不只是为了诺曼，不只是为了困住怪物，说出来，你一直想要的究竟是什么！究竟为什么留在嘉年华！","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1060102},{"step":130,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我想要的……我想要什么……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1060102},{"step":131,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你还在不安，还在迷茫，所以——你才创造了我！你没有解脱！你无法解脱！","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1060102},{"step":132,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我不知道，我不知道……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1060102},{"step":133,"content":"哈梅尔不住地摇头，你的太阳穴也持续作痛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1060102},{"step":134,"options":["安抚哈梅尔的情绪","让哈梅尔结束幻术"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101142,"trial_step":142,"course":3,"drawing":1060102,"choices":[{"text":"安抚哈梅尔的情绪","goto":143},{"text":"让哈梅尔结束幻术","goto":147}]},{"step":135,"content":"别回答它，别被幻觉里的心魔蛊惑。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1060102},{"step":136,"content":"平静下来，深呼吸，忘记它说的话。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1060102},{"step":137,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"诺曼……我留在嘉年华的原因……唔——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1060102},{"step":138,"content":"你的安抚并没有起到作用，哈梅尔抱着头痛苦地蜷缩在椅子上，重复着幽影的问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1060102,"next":[151]},{"step":139,"content":"它既然是你情绪和精神的一部分，它的出现也依赖你的幻术。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1060102},{"step":140,"content":"继续使用狂厄的能力只会让你的心绪更乱，深呼吸，结束幻境，让它消失。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1060102},{"step":141,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我……我做不到！","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1060102},{"step":142,"content":"哈梅尔抱着头痛苦地蜷缩在椅子上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1060102,"next":[151]},{"step":143,"content":"嗡——耳鸣和头疼再次袭来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1060102},{"step":144,"content":"果然，要想收服拥有强大共情能力的启迪系禁闭者，你自身也必须承担相应的代价。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1060102},{"step":145,"content":"禁闭者动荡的心境，不稳定的共情异能，枷锁的精神负担——三者形成了恶性循环！","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1060102},{"step":146,"content":"哈梅尔，快结束幻术！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1060102},{"step":147,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"这里是……哪里？我该，去往哪里？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1060102},{"step":148,"content":"哈梅尔！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1060102},{"step":149,"content":"枷锁的赤色光芒驱散了黏腻的幽影，同时也狠狠撕扯着你的神经。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1060102},{"step":150,"content":"所幸，审查室终于安静下来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1060102},{"step":151,"content":"这里没有诺曼，没有水母状的幽影，没有来自过去的舞者，一切都只是哈梅尔内心的投射。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1060100},{"step":152,"content":"她的声音有些喑哑，无助地看着你惨白的脸色，捂住胸口想要调节呼吸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1060100},{"step":153,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"那……那是我的一部分吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1060100},{"step":154,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"它在质问我？它……它伤害了你……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1060100},{"step":155,"options":["我没事","它没有伤害我"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101164,"trial_step":164,"course":3,"drawing":1060100,"choices":[{"text":"我没事","goto":165},{"text":"它没有伤害我","goto":null}]},{"step":156,"content":"我是因为你幻象的失控而承受了一些负担。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1060100},{"step":157,"content":"哈梅尔歉疚地低下头，睫毛蒙上一层水汽，轻轻颤了颤。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1060101},{"step":158,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我很想将我的一切告诉你，可是还有另一个声音，一直闷在胸口，咚——咚——","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_167"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1060101},{"step":159,"content":"所以，导致你精神不稳定的“声音”不是诺曼，而是伴随诺曼的告别而涌现的大量回忆。是二十三年前的回忆中有什么放大了你的迷茫吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1060101},{"step":160,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我无法说清……“它”不认可我的答案，甚至为了质问我，主动变成具象的实体，突然出现在我的噩梦里、幻象里……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_169"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1060100},{"step":161,"content":"哈梅尔的表达比之前更加抽象，你试图解读她的意思。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1060100},{"step":162,"content":"突然出现？那个幽影所代表的迷茫孤独，都是最近才变得格外强烈？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1060100},{"step":163,"content":"从时间上推断，这和她离开嘉年华有直接的联系。凌乱的回忆、离开嘉年华、迷茫孤独……促使她留在黑环的原因，已经渐渐清晰。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1060101},{"step":164,"content":"但看着神情恍惚的哈梅尔，你明白现在还不是揭示一切的时机。你不能再为她脆弱的精神增加压力了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1060101},{"step":165,"options":["安抚哈梅尔"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101174,"trial_step":174,"course":3,"drawing":1060101,"choices":[{"text":"安抚哈梅尔","goto":175}]},{"step":166,"content":"那个具象出的幽影说你正在困惑、迷茫、孤独……但这不是你的错。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1060101},{"step":167,"content":"能与黑环共度二十三年，避免了诺曼和更多人误入险境，你已经做得很好了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1060101},{"step":168,"content":"哈梅尔紧蹙的眉头仍没有松开。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1060101},{"step":169,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"二十三年后的今天，我还能得到答案吗？那个连我自己都快忘记了的，留在嘉年华的原因……","voice":["vo_trial_60101_1_178"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1060100},{"step":170,"content":"一定可以的。\n不自觉的念头，通常才是潜意识深处真正想要的东西，我会帮你找到答案的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160101179,"trial_step":179,"drawing":1060100}]}